{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/29e21d8b36418480566e2acc4a617f02.avif?t=1753842121\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/cb2411cb181982601037011012536ec2.webp?t=1753842121\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to <strong>monitor live surveillance feeds for a mysterious organization</strong>, keeping a <strong>close eye on the rooms for any anomalies.</strong> Whether it\u2019s furniture moving on its own or something more <strong>sinister</strong>, you\u2019ll need to <strong>report each anomaly by clicking on it and selecting its type or choosing the correct location and description from a menu.</strong> With anomalies appearing at random, every moment is unpredictable. <strong>Let too many go unnoticed, and the consequences could be deadly.</strong> Your objective is simple: <strong>survive the night shift from midnight to 6 AM.</strong> Stay alert, rely on your memory, and keep your focus, this job isn\u2019t for the faint of heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/b31171790515d6c3bcc50a71347178af.poster.avif?t=1753842121\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/b31171790515d6c3bcc50a71347178af.webm?t=1753842121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/b31171790515d6c3bcc50a71347178af.mp4?t=1753842121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/49c57bb7363b149c70945d053a914478.poster.avif?t=1753842121\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/49c57bb7363b149c70945d053a914478.webm?t=1753842121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/49c57bb7363b149c70945d053a914478.mp4?t=1753842121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/2fb38455291e39354e2899c029ad392a.webp?t=1753842121\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHOTOREALISTIC GRAPHICS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in stunning, lifelike visuals that make every detail of the surveillance footage feel real.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NORMAL &amp; DARK MODE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between lighting modes to suit your preference or enhance visibility during gameplay.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >30+ ANOMALIES PER LEVEL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a wide variety of unpredictable anomalies, each with unique behaviors and challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELL CRAFTED SOUND DESIGN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric audio cues and immersive sound effects heighten the suspense and keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RANDOM ANOMALY PATTERN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two playthroughs are the same, ensuring a fresh and unpredictable experience every time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLE CCTV ROOMS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor different locations simultaneously, testing your multitasking skills.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTERACTIVE REPORTING SYSTEM</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >File anomaly reports by selecting the correct type and location from a detailed menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you going to complete your mission? You'll find out in CLAMO.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503220?t=1753842121","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/a5d060c48681354a71f35b81d97b6c522bcd21fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753842121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/ed944a04eba38bf9e0d9355f7b9ca3316552d928/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753842121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/ed944a04eba38bf9e0d9355f7b9ca3316552d928/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753842121","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains: flashing lights, loud noises, jumpscares."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/29e21d8b36418480566e2acc4a617f02.avif?t=1753842121\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app