ires filing a report detailing its type and location. With observation and memory, you must survive, and uncover hidden secrets.","steam_appid":3503220,"support_info":{"email":"screamvault@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}